  "body": [
    "With Semrush One, you get access to the SEO and AI Visibility toolkits that unlock brand visibility across the web.",
    "Written by Leigh McKenzie",
    "Let’s be honest. You’re not just here for a discount. You want to know if Semrush is worth it — if it’ll actually help you grow your traffic, beat competitors, and drive results.",
    "Short answer: it will.",
    "Longer answer? Semrush is one of the few tools I’ve used for 10+ years that keeps getting more valuable over time. Not just for traditional SEO. But for AI search visibility, content, paid, social, and competitive research too.",
    "So yes, you can grab a free trial (link below), but this page will show you exactly why it’s worth using beyond the trial.",
    "Semrush is innovating like crazy when it comes to analyzing LLM visibility.",
    "You can:",
    "Track your brands performance in Google AI Mode, SearchGPT, and Perplexity",
    "Learn what the most important citation sources are in your industry",
    "Explore one of the largest (and ever groing) databases of LLM prompts",
    "Semrush helps you go deeper than basic keyword volume.",
    "You can:",
    "Segment keywords by intent (great for building funnel-based content)",
    "See trends over time (so you don’t chase declining terms)",
    "Group keywords by topic clusters instantly",
    "You can type in any domain and see:",
    "Their top-performing pages",
    "Which keywords are driving traffic",
    "What their backlink strategy looks like",
    "It’s not just data—it’s a blueprint.",
    "Most audit tools drown you in technical jargon. Semrush gives you a prioritized list of fixes, sorted by impact.",
    "You can:",
    "Run audits on any site",
    "Track fixes over time",
    "Get clear explanations and fix recommendations",
    "Most free or cheap tools update rankings once a week (if that). Semrush updates them daily and lets you:",
    "Track keywords by location and device",
    "Set up alerts for ranking changes",
    "Create simple reports for clients or stakeholders",
    "You get:",
    "AI-powered topic suggestions",
    "On-page SEO templates",
    "SERP feature analysis (so you know what you’re up against)",
    "Plus, it integrates directly with Google Docs so you can optimize as you write.",
    "If you run ads, write blog posts, or manage a brand, Semrush helps you:",
    "Analyze PPC keywords",
    "Track social media engagement",
    "Monitor brand mentions and PR hits",
    "That makes it one of the few tools that connects all your marketing efforts in one place.",
    "Search is changing. Fast.",
    "Semrush keeps up by adding:",
    "AI writing assistance",
    "Tools for zero-click SERPs",
    "Data for YouTube, TikTok, Amazon, and more",
    "You’re not just buying a tool—you’re investing in staying ahead of what’s next.",
    "Totally biased take: yes.",
    "Unbiased reality: there’s no downside to trying it free.",
    "You get full access to:",
    "Pro-level keyword and competitor research",
    "Technical SEO audits",
    "Daily rank tracking",
    "Content and backlink tools",
    "And if it’s not for you? Just cancel before your trial ends. No charge.",
    "Ready to test it for yourself?",
    "What exactly is Semrush One?",
    "Semrush One is a new plan that gives you access to two of Semrush’s most powerful toolkits: Their classic SEO toolkit and their AI Visibility toolkit. This is the perfect plan for anyone who cares about winning every search across the web.",
