    "This discount is automatically applied when you use our link.",
    "Is this the best available Semrush discount?",
    "Yes, this combines the maximum authorized discount (17% off annual plans) with the longest trial period (14 days).",
    "Can I cancel during the trial?",
    "Yes, cancel anytime during the 14-day trial with no charges.",
    "How do I get the 17% discount?",
    "After your trial, simply choose an annual plan to automatically save 17%."
